WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.628 --> 00:00:32.231
<i>The wilds of Sri Lanka,</i>

2
00:00:32.233 --> 00:00:34.266
<i>land of myth and legend.</i>

3
00:00:41.307 --> 00:00:47.379
<i>Where rocky pinnacles overlook</i>
<i>vast tropical forests.</i>

4
00:00:49.616 --> 00:00:55.587
<i>And an abandoned city</i>
<i>lies shrouded in jungle.</i>

5
00:00:55.589 --> 00:00:59.591
<i>The kings who once reigned</i>
<i>here are long gone.</i>

6
00:00:59.593 --> 00:01:03.862
<i>These days, there's a new</i>
<i>dynasty in residence.</i>

7
00:01:03.864 --> 00:01:09.401
<i>But this one is governed by</i>
<i>the law of the jungle.</i>

8
00:02:28.548 --> 00:02:30.149
<i>I know what you're thinking.</i>

9
00:02:30.151 --> 00:02:34.319
<i>"Being a macaque monkey</i>
<i>is just fun and games."</i>

10
00:02:34.321 --> 00:02:37.689
<i>But, actually,</i>
<i>it's an intricate society</i>

11
00:02:37.691 --> 00:02:38.790
<i>of 50 members</i>

12
00:02:38.792 --> 00:02:42.294
<i>bound together</i>
<i>by a strict social order.</i>

13
00:02:43.029 --> 00:02:46.098
<i>In this troop,</i>
<i>every waking moment</i>

14
00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:48.267
<i>is a reminder of your place.</i>

15
00:02:49.135 --> 00:02:52.671
<i>From a seemingly</i>
<i>innocent greeting.</i>

16
00:02:53.339 --> 00:02:56.308
<i>Oh! He'll learn.</i>

17
00:02:56.310 --> 00:02:58.343
<i>To your choice</i>
<i>of sleeping branch.</i>

18
00:02:58.345 --> 00:03:01.947
<i>Upper class,</i>
<i>basking in the morning sun.</i>

19
00:03:01.949 --> 00:03:06.251
<i>Lower class,</i>
<i>shivering in the cold.</i>

20
00:03:08.021 --> 00:03:10.422
<i>Your social rank</i>
<i>even determines</i>

21
00:03:10.424 --> 00:03:12.858
<i>what you can eat.</i>

22
00:03:14.027 --> 00:03:16.762
<i>Nowhere is that clearer</i>
<i>than here.</i>

23
00:03:16.764 --> 00:03:21.099
<i>The kingdom's</i>
<i>most prized fig tree.</i>

24
00:03:31.277 --> 00:03:34.213
<i>Only those at the top</i>
<i>of the social ladder</i>

25
00:03:34.215 --> 00:03:36.181
<i>can eat at the top of the tree</i>

26
00:03:36.183 --> 00:03:38.283
<i>where the ripest fruit</i>
<i>is found.</i>

27
00:03:39.118 --> 00:03:44.690
<i>And at the very top,</i>
<i>the alpha male himself,</i>

28
00:03:44.692 --> 00:03:46.658
<i>Raja.</i>

29
00:03:51.097 --> 00:03:55.467
<i>He is the king</i>
<i>of Monkey Kingdom.</i>

30
00:03:56.603 --> 00:04:01.406
<i>See that move?</i>
<i>That's macaque for "Back off."</i>

31
00:04:04.177 --> 00:04:09.248
<i>Raja arrived from the outside</i>
<i>and fought his way to the top.</i>

32
00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:10.182
<i>So, you know,</i>

33
00:04:10.184 --> 00:04:12.251
<i>he's earned the pampering.</i>

34
00:04:12.253 --> 00:04:14.553
<i>But, if he wants to stay</i>
<i>on top,</i>

35
00:04:14.555 --> 00:04:18.323
<i>he's gotta keep</i>
<i>the real power brokers happy.</i>

36
00:04:18.325 --> 00:04:22.361
<i>The three females</i>
<i>on the other high branches.</i>

37
00:04:23.229 --> 00:04:26.431
<i>The queens behind the king.</i>

38
00:04:26.666 --> 00:04:29.234
<i>The Sisterhood.</i>

39
00:04:29.236 --> 00:04:32.771
<i>Whether you remember them</i>
<i>by their red faces</i>

40
00:04:32.773 --> 00:04:35.440
<i>or their ruthless natures,</i>

41
00:04:35.608 --> 00:04:39.678
<i>you will remember them.</i>

42
00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:44.883
<i>These ladies</i>
<i>get what they want.</i>

43
00:04:44.885 --> 00:04:48.320
<i>Their children</i>
<i>get what they want.</i>

44
00:04:48.322 --> 00:04:51.189
<i>Everything that is good</i>
<i>in the forest</i>

45
00:04:51.191 --> 00:04:53.892
<i>is reserved for them.</i>

46
00:04:55.161 --> 00:04:56.928
<i>Like royalty,</i>

47
00:04:56.930 --> 00:04:58.096
<i>they were born into privilege,</i>

48
00:04:58.098 --> 00:05:01.533
<i>and that's the way</i>
<i>it's gonna stay.</i>

49
00:05:07.273 --> 00:05:10.242
<i>Do not get on their bad side.</i>

50
00:05:15.581 --> 00:05:20.085
<i>Descending the tree,</i>
<i>we descend the social ladder.</i>

51
00:05:20.087 --> 00:05:20.852
<i>With each branch,</i>

52
00:05:20.854 --> 00:05:26.158
<i>the fruit is less ripe,</i>
<i>and the monkey lower in rank.</i>

53
00:05:27.093 --> 00:05:28.126
<i>Until,</i>

54
00:05:28.128 --> 00:05:32.364
<i>at the bottom,</i>
<i>the heroine of this story,</i>

55
00:05:32.366 --> 00:05:34.399
<i>Maya.</i>

56
00:05:36.102 --> 00:05:38.570
<i>Maya's got big, friendly eyes,</i>

57
00:05:38.572 --> 00:05:41.106
<i>three distinctive spots</i>
<i>on her nose,</i>

58
00:05:41.108 --> 00:05:46.178
<i>and, I think you'll agree,</i>
<i>a pretty rad hairdo.</i>

59
00:05:46.546 --> 00:05:51.216
<i>She was born eight years ago,</i>
<i>at the bottom of the troop,</i>

60
00:05:51.218 --> 00:05:53.251
<i>just like her mother.</i>

61
00:05:53.253 --> 00:05:56.488
<i>And her mother before that.</i>

62
00:05:58.391 --> 00:06:03.095
<i>When you're at the bottom,</i>
<i>you're either in the way,</i>

63
00:06:03.097 --> 00:06:05.931
<i>or you don't even exist.</i>

64
00:06:08.735 --> 00:06:10.068
<i>But every day,</i>

65
00:06:10.070 --> 00:06:13.238
<i>you're paying your dues</i>
<i>to monkeys like Raja</i>

66
00:06:13.240 --> 00:06:16.608
<i>without any chance</i>
<i>of promotion.</i>

67
00:06:23.049 --> 00:06:26.852
<i>And so,</i>
<i>back under the fig tree,</i>

68
00:06:26.854 --> 00:06:31.156
<i>Maya takes whatever scraps</i>
<i>fall her way.</i>

69
00:06:32.959 --> 00:06:38.597
<i>A low-born like herself simply</i>
<i>can't improve her position</i>

70
00:06:38.599 --> 00:06:42.300
<i>or dream of eating</i>
<i>from a higher branch.</i>

71
00:06:42.302 --> 00:06:43.335
<i>Yet this is the story</i>

72
00:06:43.337 --> 00:06:46.905
<i>of how Maya fights</i>
<i>to beat the odds</i>

73
00:06:46.907 --> 00:06:49.174
<i>and make a better life.</i>

74
00:06:53.980 --> 00:06:58.483
<i>For Maya and the troop,</i>
<i>home is Castle Rock,</i>

75
00:06:58.485 --> 00:07:00.552
<i>a magnificent granite outcrop</i>

76
00:07:00.554 --> 00:07:03.121
<i>at the center of the kingdom.</i>

77
00:07:03.123 --> 00:07:08.527
<i>It's the most sought-after</i>
<i>residence for miles around.</i>

78
00:07:09.262 --> 00:07:12.030
<i>It's a pretty sweet</i>
<i>neighborhood.</i>

79
00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:16.401
<i>Sweeping views</i>
<i>of their territory</i>

80
00:07:16.403 --> 00:07:19.871
<i>are perfect</i>
<i>for spotting rivals.</i>

81
00:07:21.007 --> 00:07:23.475
<i>It's got plenty of rec rooms,</i>

82
00:07:23.477 --> 00:07:26.912
<i>nature's finest roof,</i>
<i>and, of course,</i>

83
00:07:26.914 --> 00:07:29.781
<i>the original jungle gym.</i>

84
00:07:35.888 --> 00:07:38.423
<i>The monkeys think</i>
<i>they own this rock</i>

85
00:07:38.425 --> 00:07:42.027
<i>but there are some tenants.</i>

86
00:07:43.596 --> 00:07:46.431
<i>There's a mongoose</i>
<i>in the building.</i>

87
00:07:48.202 --> 00:07:51.837
<i>Day after day</i>
<i>they ask him to play.</i>

88
00:07:51.839 --> 00:07:54.906
<i>And his answer is always,</i>

89
00:07:55.041 --> 00:07:57.375
<i>"No, thank you."</i>

90
00:08:05.017 --> 00:08:10.155
<i>But rejection only increases</i>
<i>their determination.</i>

91
00:08:10.157 --> 00:08:12.624
<i>They will play</i>
<i>with this mongoose</i>

92
00:08:12.626 --> 00:08:15.460
<i>if it is the last thing</i>
<i>they do.</i>

93
00:08:25.238 --> 00:08:27.272
<i>Nothing will stop them.</i>

94
00:08:31.878 --> 00:08:34.946
<i>Even his absence.</i>

95
00:08:37.783 --> 00:08:40.352
<i>Continuing their search...</i>

96
00:08:40.820 --> 00:08:42.854
<i>"Sloth bear!"</i>

97
00:08:44.524 --> 00:08:47.192
<i>"It's cool.</i>
<i>I knew he was in there.</i>

98
00:08:47.194 --> 00:08:48.627
<i>"Just a bear."</i>

99
00:08:48.629 --> 00:08:52.330
<i>Mama sloth bear</i>
<i>is keeping her cubs cool,</i>

100
00:08:52.332 --> 00:08:54.399
<i>rehydrating them with</i>

101
00:08:54.401 --> 00:08:56.768
<i>her saliva.</i>

102
00:08:59.772 --> 00:09:03.341
<i>She's also keeping her cubs</i>
<i>safe from</i>

103
00:09:03.343 --> 00:09:08.146
<i>this guy,</i>
<i>the unwelcome suitor outside.</i>

104
00:09:10.816 --> 00:09:13.585
<i>Mama keeps her cubs well hidden</i>

105
00:09:13.587 --> 00:09:16.621
<i>until he leaves, or...</i>

106
00:09:17.823 --> 00:09:19.691
<i>That'll do.</i>

107
00:09:19.693 --> 00:09:23.395
<i>He's not dead.</i>
<i>He's just asleep.</i>

108
00:09:36.676 --> 00:09:38.076
<i>Every morning,</i>

109
00:09:38.078 --> 00:09:39.477
<i>the troop leaves Castle Rock</i>

110
00:09:39.479 --> 00:09:42.881
<i>to scour the forest</i>
<i>for breakfast.</i>

111
00:09:53.359 --> 00:09:57.729
<i>Maya can't afford</i>
<i>to be a picky eater.</i>

112
00:09:59.231 --> 00:10:02.033
<i>Don't worry.</i>
<i>Bambi's not on the menu.</i>

113
00:10:02.035 --> 00:10:07.238
<i>And this squirrel won't seem</i>
<i>to give up his food. Oh.</i>

114
00:10:07.473 --> 00:10:12.444
<i>But, uh,</i>
<i>maybe this is promising.</i>

115
00:10:20.653 --> 00:10:21.886
<i>Ugh.</i>

116
00:10:25.024 --> 00:10:28.026
<i>At nearly 40 years old,</i>

117
00:10:28.028 --> 00:10:29.494
<i>Grandpa only moves</i>

118
00:10:29.496 --> 00:10:32.964
<i>when the group tells him</i>
<i>it's worthwhile.</i>

119
00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:38.236
<i>That's monkey-speak</i>
<i>for "Jackpot!"</i>

120
00:10:42.274 --> 00:10:45.310
<i>But guess who got there first.</i>

121
00:10:45.312 --> 00:10:49.180
<i>Mushrooms are like</i>
<i>potato chips for the sisters.</i>

122
00:10:49.182 --> 00:10:53.418
<i>Once they start,</i>
<i>they just can't stop.</i>

123
00:10:54.520 --> 00:10:58.890
<i>Maya waits. This is what</i>
<i>it means to be last in line.</i>

124
00:10:58.892 --> 00:11:03.128
<i>By the time your turn comes,</i>
<i>there's nothing left.</i>

125
00:11:19.178 --> 00:11:23.481
<i>Midday, a scorcher.</i>

126
00:11:29.055 --> 00:11:32.657
<i>Too much lunch.</i>

127
00:11:34.593 --> 00:11:39.297
<i>It's already Grandpa's</i>
<i>fourth nap of the day.</i>

128
00:11:42.301 --> 00:11:45.970
<i>Raja and the sisters</i>
<i>enjoy the sweet dreams</i>

129
00:11:45.972 --> 00:11:48.239
<i>of the high-born.</i>

130
00:11:50.109 --> 00:11:53.044
<i>Maya, on the other hand...</i>

131
00:11:53.046 --> 00:11:57.315
<i>The sisters' kids</i>
<i>don't feel like napping.</i>

132
00:11:58.017 --> 00:12:02.253
<i>Maya makes</i>
<i>the best play structure.</i>

133
00:12:05.057 --> 00:12:06.491
<i>She'd love to object,</i>

134
00:12:06.493 --> 00:12:08.693
<i>but one swat</i>
<i>at the sisters' kids</i>

135
00:12:08.695 --> 00:12:11.930
<i>and there would be big trouble.</i>

136
00:12:13.265 --> 00:12:15.533
<i>Maya just has to take it.</i>

137
00:12:15.535 --> 00:12:19.237
<i>Even if they use her tail</i>
<i>as a rope swing.</i>

138
00:12:19.239 --> 00:12:21.573
<i>That's gotta hurt.</i>

139
00:12:40.226 --> 00:12:43.595
<i>"Guys, don't mess</i>
<i>with the hair."</i>

140
00:12:48.701 --> 00:12:50.034
<i>At just one month old,</i>

141
00:12:50.036 --> 00:12:53.638
<i>these kids already know</i>
<i>Maya's place.</i>

142
00:12:54.306 --> 00:12:57.208
<i>And it's not up there.</i>

143
00:12:59.545 --> 00:13:03.948
<i>So they can poke Maya</i>
<i>in the eye repeatedly.</i>

144
00:13:08.020 --> 00:13:12.157
<i>And forage for food</i>
<i>inside her mouth!</i>

145
00:13:12.159 --> 00:13:13.892
<i>That's rude.</i>

146
00:13:16.695 --> 00:13:18.930
<i>Maya will never know</i>
<i>the sweet life,</i>

147
00:13:18.932 --> 00:13:23.101
<i>but she does get a break</i>
<i>occasionally.</i>

148
00:13:30.142 --> 00:13:33.111
<i>To de-stress, macaques visit</i>

149
00:13:33.113 --> 00:13:34.345
<i>their less</i>
<i>sophisticated cousins,</i>

150
00:13:34.347 --> 00:13:38.116
<i>the langurs,</i>
<i>treating them like pets.</i>

151
00:13:38.717 --> 00:13:43.988
<i>Seems to lower the blood</i>
<i>pressure and calm the nerves.</i>

152
00:13:43.990 --> 00:13:45.423
<i>The langurs don't mind.</i>

153
00:13:45.425 --> 00:13:49.661
<i>In fact,</i>
<i>they may not even notice.</i>

154
00:13:51.697 --> 00:13:54.732
<i>Not the sharpest tools</i>
<i>in the shed,</i>

155
00:13:54.734 --> 00:13:56.634
<i>these guys.</i>

156
00:14:03.242 --> 00:14:07.912
<i>And if you want a super fun,</i>
<i>stimulating playmate,</i>

157
00:14:07.914 --> 00:14:11.216
<i>you might have to keep looking.</i>

158
00:14:39.778 --> 00:14:41.145
<i>Now, on the other hand,</i>

159
00:14:41.147 --> 00:14:43.314
<i>a group of intelligent monkeys</i>

160
00:14:43.316 --> 00:14:46.751
<i>is very hard to sneak up on.</i>

161
00:14:47.253 --> 00:14:48.486
<i>Even engrossed in grooming,</i>

162
00:14:48.488 --> 00:14:54.325
<i>Maya has the eyes of her troop</i>
<i>looking out for danger.</i>

163
00:15:31.531 --> 00:15:33.765
<i>The alarm is sounded.</i>

164
00:15:51.116 --> 00:15:52.850
<i>The close escape</i>

165
00:15:52.852 --> 00:15:54.419
<i>is a chilling reminder for Maya</i>

166
00:15:54.421 --> 00:15:58.623
<i>of why she can never leave</i>
<i>her group.</i>

167
00:16:00.492 --> 00:16:03.294
<i>Life at the bottom may be hard,</i>

168
00:16:03.296 --> 00:16:05.363
<i>but striking out on her own</i>

169
00:16:05.365 --> 00:16:08.733
<i>would be too dangerous.</i>

170
00:16:12.004 --> 00:16:13.938
<i>While Maya can't leave,</i>

171
00:16:13.940 --> 00:16:17.842
<i>that doesn't mean something</i>
<i>good can't come to her.</i>

172
00:16:24.383 --> 00:16:27.585
<i>His name is Kumar.</i>

173
00:16:28.053 --> 00:16:31.289
<i>15 pounds of hunky monkey.</i>

174
00:16:55.881 --> 00:16:57.348
<i>Like all young males,</i>

175
00:16:57.350 --> 00:17:00.485
<i>this dashing newcomer</i>
<i>left his birth troop</i>

176
00:17:00.487 --> 00:17:02.820
<i>to find a permanent home.</i>

177
00:17:05.157 --> 00:17:06.724
<i>Maya sizes him up.</i>

178
00:17:13.032 --> 00:17:15.833
<i>Kumar is giving Maya the eye.</i>

179
00:17:17.770 --> 00:17:20.238
<i>If Raja catches Kumar flirting,</i>

180
00:17:20.240 --> 00:17:22.907
<i>he'll drive the newcomer away.</i>

181
00:17:23.275 --> 00:17:26.210
<i>Kumar can't get kicked out now.</i>

182
00:17:27.746 --> 00:17:30.048
<i>It's courtship season.</i>

183
00:17:55.541 --> 00:17:57.041
<i>Males throughout the forest</i>

184
00:17:57.043 --> 00:18:00.044
<i>are pulling out their</i>
<i>best moves.</i>

185
00:18:02.114 --> 00:18:04.916
<i>Kumar is no exception.</i>

186
00:18:10.989 --> 00:18:13.624
<i>But he's got a problem.</i>

187
00:18:13.626 --> 00:18:18.796
<i>There's that Raja again,</i>
<i>guarding Maya for himself.</i>

188
00:18:20.833 --> 00:18:23.901
<i>If Kumar knows</i>
<i>what's good for him,</i>

189
00:18:23.903 --> 00:18:27.438
<i>he'll stay under the radar.</i>

190
00:18:27.440 --> 00:18:30.675
<i>"Nobody here, nope."</i>

191
00:18:30.677 --> 00:18:33.945
<i>"I'm just waiting</i>
<i>for a friend."</i>

192
00:18:34.913 --> 00:18:39.117
<i>Maya is smart enough</i>
<i>to pretend not to care.</i>

193
00:18:39.119 --> 00:18:43.087
<i>Raja's position as alpha</i>
<i>gives him first rights</i>

194
00:18:43.089 --> 00:18:45.490
<i>in all things.</i>

195
00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:55.099
<i>Raja won't give Maya</i>
<i>the time of day.</i>

196
00:18:55.101 --> 00:18:58.302
<i>Then, when she's finally</i>
<i>got an admirer,</i>

197
00:18:58.971 --> 00:19:00.938
<i>guess who's hanging around.</i>

198
00:19:00.940 --> 00:19:04.041
<i>Oh, sure. Now he's interested.</i>

199
00:19:12.718 --> 00:19:17.121
<i>Come on, Kumar.</i>
<i>Just play it cool, man.</i>

200
00:19:27.533 --> 00:19:29.901
<i>Kumar needs to try</i>
<i>something different.</i>

201
00:19:29.903 --> 00:19:33.504
<i>Like, maybe, I don't know, uh,</i>

202
00:19:33.506 --> 00:19:37.875
<i>the exact same thing from</i>
<i>the other side of the tree.</i>

203
00:19:39.278 --> 00:19:43.614
<i>No matter. Maya knows raw</i>
<i>potential when she sees it.</i>

204
00:19:49.488 --> 00:19:51.455
<i>Finally, with Raja distracted,</i>

205
00:19:51.457 --> 00:19:55.126
<i>she takes matters</i>
<i>into her own hands.</i>

206
00:20:20.786 --> 00:20:25.756
<i>"Where'd she go? What?</i>
<i>Wait a minute."</i>

207
00:20:45.444 --> 00:20:48.546
<i>Raja knows he's been tricked.</i>

208
00:20:48.548 --> 00:20:52.350
<i>Kumar would be wise to lay low.</i>

209
00:20:54.820 --> 00:20:59.090
<i>Instead, he boldly strides</i>
<i>back into the group,</i>

210
00:20:59.092 --> 00:21:01.292
<i>straight up to Raja.</i>

211
00:21:07.132 --> 00:21:09.600
<i>His henchmen lend their muscle.</i>

212
00:21:22.247 --> 00:21:24.715
<i>Kumar is expelled.</i>

213
00:21:35.794 --> 00:21:38.629
<i>Maya watches him retreat.</i>

214
00:21:38.631 --> 00:21:42.066
<i>This means goodbye.</i>

215
00:21:47.539 --> 00:21:52.343
<i>Maya returns under Raja's</i>
<i>hostile stare.</i>

216
00:21:57.382 --> 00:22:01.052
<i>It's back to business as usual,</i>

217
00:22:01.054 --> 00:22:03.387
<i>or so it would seem.</i>

218
00:22:20.072 --> 00:22:21.339
<i>Six months later,</i>

219
00:22:21.341 --> 00:22:26.043
<i>something has happened</i>
<i>that changes everything.</i>

220
00:22:31.950 --> 00:22:37.054
<i>Maya has given birth</i>
<i>to Kumar's son.</i>

221
00:22:44.696 --> 00:22:48.065
<i>Welcome to the world, Kip.</i>

222
00:22:52.371 --> 00:22:57.074
<i>Maya is consumed</i>
<i>by unconditional love.</i>

223
00:23:07.919 --> 00:23:11.522
<i>She is lost in her infant.</i>

224
00:23:23.735 --> 00:23:24.935
<i>To keep her milk flowing,</i>

225
00:23:24.937 --> 00:23:29.573
<i>Maya no longer has the option</i>
<i>of skipping meals.</i>

226
00:23:29.908 --> 00:23:31.909
<i>And with Kumar gone,</i>

227
00:23:31.911 --> 00:23:35.846
<i>keeping Kip safe won't be easy.</i>

228
00:23:42.220 --> 00:23:46.123
<i>The sisters enjoy</i>
<i>a network of nannies,</i>

229
00:23:46.125 --> 00:23:49.260
<i>not to mention</i>
<i>paternal support.</i>

230
00:23:49.262 --> 00:23:54.064
<i>Maya will have to do this</i>
<i>on her own.</i>

231
00:24:04.075 --> 00:24:06.677
<i>Now more than ever,</i>

232
00:24:06.679 --> 00:24:10.614
<i>Maya must overcome her rank</i>
<i>and beat the system.</i>

233
00:24:10.616 --> 00:24:15.052
<i>Her son's future depends on it.</i>

234
00:24:25.764 --> 00:24:29.099
<i>Little Kip has arrived</i>
<i>just in time</i>

235
00:24:29.101 --> 00:24:31.836
<i>for monsoon season.</i>

236
00:24:42.013 --> 00:24:45.182
<i>If you thought taking care of</i>
<i>a newborn baby was hard,</i>

237
00:24:45.184 --> 00:24:50.120
<i>try doing it during weeks</i>
<i>and weeks of downpour.</i>

238
00:25:12.978 --> 00:25:16.614
<i>Castle Rock would make</i>
<i>an ideal shelter</i>

239
00:25:16.616 --> 00:25:17.548
<i>for an infant,</i>

240
00:25:17.550 --> 00:25:20.351
<i>but it's reserved for the VIPs,</i>

241
00:25:20.353 --> 00:25:22.253
<i>whose firsthand experience</i>
<i>of rain</i>

242
00:25:22.255 --> 00:25:25.222
<i>is limited.</i>

243
00:25:33.398 --> 00:25:36.467
<i>Kip would be much better off</i>

244
00:25:36.469 --> 00:25:38.536
<i>under there.</i>

245
00:25:41.873 --> 00:25:43.407
<i>Maya can only shake it off,</i>

246
00:25:43.409 --> 00:25:48.712
<i>and try to prevent Kip</i>
<i>from getting dangerously cold.</i>

247
00:25:53.652 --> 00:25:57.354
<i>Few of the kingdom's creatures</i>
<i>enjoy the rain.</i>

248
00:26:01.126 --> 00:26:02.826
<i>At least the elephants get to</i>

249
00:26:02.828 --> 00:26:04.428
<i>apply wet mud to their backs,</i>

250
00:26:04.430 --> 00:26:08.499
<i>which works like sunscreen</i>
<i>when it dries.</i>

251
00:26:22.013 --> 00:26:25.049
<i>Monsoon winds blowing off</i>
<i>the Himalayas</i>

252
00:26:25.051 --> 00:26:27.885
<i>have brought more rain</i>
<i>in the last few weeks</i>

253
00:26:27.887 --> 00:26:31.689
<i>than in the rest</i>
<i>of the year combined.</i>

254
00:26:51.109 --> 00:26:54.345
<i>The water soaks deep</i>
<i>into the ground.</i>

255
00:26:54.347 --> 00:26:58.582
<i>In a few months</i>
<i>it'll bring a glut of fruit.</i>

256
00:26:58.584 --> 00:27:01.051
<i>But, before that...</i>

257
00:27:03.054 --> 00:27:08.359
<i>It happens for a just</i>
<i>a few hours every year.</i>

258
00:27:14.466 --> 00:27:16.133
<i>Thousands of winged termites</i>

259
00:27:16.135 --> 00:27:21.038
<i>take to the air</i>
<i>to found new colonies.</i>

260
00:27:24.242 --> 00:27:25.209
<i>For the macaques,</i>

261
00:27:25.211 --> 00:27:29.647
<i>it's every holiday meal</i>
<i>rolled into one.</i>

262
00:28:03.381 --> 00:28:03.947
<i>For Maya,</i>

263
00:28:03.949 --> 00:28:07.484
<i>termites have the two best</i>
<i>qualities in a food source,</i>

264
00:28:07.486 --> 00:28:11.889
<i>they are delicious,</i>
<i>and they are everywhere.</i>

265
00:28:29.774 --> 00:28:35.546
<i>Even the sisters can't keep</i>
<i>this feast to themselves.</i>

266
00:28:37.182 --> 00:28:41.552
<i>Maya has her very own</i>
<i>mound today.</i>

267
00:28:46.324 --> 00:28:51.128
<i>And more food for Maya</i>
<i>means more milk for Kip.</i>

268
00:28:52.931 --> 00:28:55.065
<i>Patience, little one.</i>

269
00:28:56.534 --> 00:29:01.238
<i>Everyone in the kingdom</i>
<i>shows up for termite day.</i>

270
00:29:03.675 --> 00:29:07.277
<i>Even scorpions gather</i>
<i>as much as they can</i>

271
00:29:07.279 --> 00:29:09.613
<i>to stock the pantry.</i>

272
00:29:32.704 --> 00:29:36.507
<i>Finally, Kip got his fill.</i>

273
00:29:46.684 --> 00:29:50.120
<i>The termite feast comes</i>
<i>but once a year,</i>

274
00:29:50.122 --> 00:29:54.291
<i>which leaves Maya</i>
<i>with 364 other days</i>

275
00:29:54.293 --> 00:29:56.426
<i>to provide for her son.</i>

276
00:29:56.428 --> 00:29:58.162
<i>Her growing son.</i>

277
00:30:01.566 --> 00:30:03.033
<i>Kip is getting older,</i>

278
00:30:03.035 --> 00:30:06.670
<i>reaching that age</i>
<i>when he starts to realize</i>

279
00:30:06.672 --> 00:30:10.007
<i>he's part of a larger world.</i>

280
00:30:12.377 --> 00:30:14.545
<i>Meanwhile, he's this close</i>

281
00:30:14.547 --> 00:30:16.680
<i>to understanding that his skin</i>

282
00:30:16.682 --> 00:30:20.717
<i>is actually attached</i>
<i>to his face.</i>

283
00:30:26.257 --> 00:30:27.391
<i>Like any mother,</i>

284
00:30:27.393 --> 00:30:31.895
<i>Maya probably wants</i>
<i>to freeze her child in time.</i>

285
00:30:31.897 --> 00:30:37.534
<i>This, right now,</i>
<i>this is the perfect age.</i>

286
00:30:48.746 --> 00:30:50.247
<i>Insects.</i>

287
00:30:51.716 --> 00:30:53.917
<i>Plants.</i>

288
00:30:53.919 --> 00:30:56.186
<i>The laws of physics.</i>

289
00:30:56.188 --> 00:30:57.621
<i>They'll make sense in time.</i>

290
00:30:57.623 --> 00:31:00.557
<i>It's monkeys</i>
<i>that are confusing.</i>

291
00:31:00.559 --> 00:31:03.260
<i>Infants get a pass</i>
<i>to be annoying</i>

292
00:31:03.262 --> 00:31:05.696
<i>in their early weeks.</i>

293
00:31:05.698 --> 00:31:10.267
<i>Older monkeys just have to</i>
<i>look the other way.</i>

294
00:31:13.304 --> 00:31:16.473
<i>Sometimes it's extremely hard.</i>

295
00:31:24.515 --> 00:31:27.751
<i>But not everyone</i>
<i>plays by the rules.</i>

296
00:31:30.822 --> 00:31:33.824
<i>Like the sisters and Raja.</i>

297
00:31:33.826 --> 00:31:37.227
<i>Especially not for Maya's kid.</i>

298
00:31:44.369 --> 00:31:49.172
<i>And so,</i>
<i>Kip discovers his place.</i>

299
00:31:51.910 --> 00:31:54.177
<i>With termite season long gone,</i>

300
00:31:54.179 --> 00:31:56.813
<i>cassia flowers</i>
<i>are what's on the menu.</i>

301
00:31:56.815 --> 00:32:01.785
<i>For Raja, the sisters,</i>
<i>and their children, that is.</i>

302
00:32:05.957 --> 00:32:08.158
<i>To feed herself and Kip today,</i>

303
00:32:08.160 --> 00:32:11.695
<i>Maya will have to get creative.</i>

304
00:32:15.533 --> 00:32:19.336
<i>Maya's nothing, if not scrappy.</i>

305
00:32:19.804 --> 00:32:22.239
<i>She's got a plan B.</i>

306
00:32:22.241 --> 00:32:24.775
<i>With other hungry monkeys</i>
<i>in tow,</i>

307
00:32:24.777 --> 00:32:27.544
<i>Maya takes the lead.</i>

308
00:32:29.747 --> 00:32:32.049
<i>It's an opportunity</i>
<i>the high-born</i>

309
00:32:32.051 --> 00:32:34.718
<i>wouldn't even recognize.</i>

310
00:32:49.901 --> 00:32:54.538
<i>The lily pond is a spot</i>
<i>known for predators.</i>

311
00:32:58.109 --> 00:33:02.179
<i>But today,</i>
<i>the coast seems clear.</i>

312
00:33:02.780 --> 00:33:08.652
<i>Maya digs in, harvesting</i>
<i>the seed pods of water lilies.</i>

313
00:33:23.468 --> 00:33:27.004
<i>Grandpa will sit this one out.</i>

314
00:33:36.080 --> 00:33:38.782
<i>When the easy pickings</i>
<i>are gone,</i>

315
00:33:38.784 --> 00:33:42.552
<i>you've gotta get</i>
<i>a bit more adventurous.</i>

316
00:33:47.592 --> 00:33:51.128
<i>Maya treads carefully.</i>

317
00:34:13.351 --> 00:34:16.353
<i>It's Maya who makes</i>
<i>the first move</i>

318
00:34:16.355 --> 00:34:17.621
<i>into the deeper waters.</i>

319
00:34:17.623 --> 00:34:21.658
<i>Kip will go along for the ride.</i>

320
00:34:26.964 --> 00:34:29.332
<i>The younger monkeys follow.</i>

321
00:34:29.334 --> 00:34:31.468
<i>But even the bravest hesitate</i>

322
00:34:31.470 --> 00:34:35.939
<i>over this next incredible step.</i>

323
00:34:46.851 --> 00:34:50.654
<i>Did you know</i>
<i>monkeys could swim?</i>

324
00:36:00.224 --> 00:36:03.927
<i>For Kip,</i>
<i>it's been a day of firsts.</i>

325
00:36:03.929 --> 00:36:05.428
<i>First swim lesson,</i>

326
00:36:05.430 --> 00:36:10.000
<i>first lily-seed pod</i>
<i>and now, this.</i>

327
00:36:14.572 --> 00:36:17.274
<i>A monitor lizard.</i>

328
00:36:23.347 --> 00:36:28.919
<i>7 feet long,</i>
<i>a deadly ambush predator.</i>

329
00:36:35.059 --> 00:36:41.064
<i>His most lethal weapon,</i>
<i>the element of surprise.</i>

330
00:36:50.241 --> 00:36:53.543
<i>Maya hasn't spotted the lizard.</i>

331
00:37:12.863 --> 00:37:16.399
<i>In the chaos,</i>
<i>Maya has gotten Kip to safety.</i>

332
00:37:16.401 --> 00:37:19.603
<i>But not before one of their</i>
<i>own has fallen.</i>

333
00:37:43.995 --> 00:37:48.331
<i>After a night spent</i>
<i>wet, cold, and shaken,</i>

334
00:37:48.333 --> 00:37:51.134
<i>the low-born recover.</i>

335
00:37:55.573 --> 00:37:58.375
<i>Maya isn't sleeping in.</i>

336
00:37:58.377 --> 00:38:01.311
<i>She's got a growing son</i>
<i>to feed.</i>

337
00:38:16.027 --> 00:38:18.928
<i>Maya finds a patch</i>
<i>of caterpillars,</i>

338
00:38:18.930 --> 00:38:21.731
<i>perfect for enriching her milk.</i>

339
00:38:34.245 --> 00:38:37.747
<i>Kip should be eating</i>
<i>soon enough.</i>

340
00:38:48.559 --> 00:38:54.364
<i>The sisters believe any food</i>
<i>patch is their food patch.</i>

341
00:39:01.505 --> 00:39:02.872
<i>They mount an attack,</i>

342
00:39:02.874 --> 00:39:05.308
<i>driving Maya away from her son.</i>

343
00:39:13.351 --> 00:39:16.252
<i>Kip is stolen away.</i>

344
00:39:21.292 --> 00:39:26.129
<i>Maya receives</i>
<i>her brutal punishment.</i>

345
00:39:26.564 --> 00:39:30.934
<i>And Kip is carried off</i>
<i>into the forest.</i>

346
00:39:46.584 --> 00:39:48.818
<i>Hours pass, and still,</i>

347
00:39:48.820 --> 00:39:52.322
<i>Maya is looking for her son.</i>

348
00:39:55.092 --> 00:39:57.927
<i>On the far side</i>
<i>of the ruined city,</i>

349
00:39:57.929 --> 00:40:01.664
<i>the sisters keep Kip close.</i>

350
00:40:04.268 --> 00:40:07.504
<i>Maya calls for her lost son.</i>

351
00:40:13.177 --> 00:40:16.479
<i>Finally, the sisters</i>
<i>lose interest,</i>

352
00:40:16.481 --> 00:40:19.115
<i>and Kip is free to leave.</i>

353
00:40:33.798 --> 00:40:38.234
<i>Kip is lost</i>
<i>and dangerously exposed.</i>

354
00:40:47.244 --> 00:40:51.314
<i>Maya has been patrolling</i>
<i>the territory for hours,</i>

355
00:40:51.316 --> 00:40:55.452
<i>straining to hear</i>
<i>her son's calls.</i>

356
00:41:05.095 --> 00:41:07.464
<i>At last.</i>

357
00:41:11.135 --> 00:41:14.137
<i>This ordeal is over.</i>

358
00:41:31.055 --> 00:41:34.357
<i>The lessons of yesterday</i>
<i>are clear.</i>

359
00:41:34.359 --> 00:41:36.059
<i>Maya will need another way</i>

360
00:41:36.061 --> 00:41:38.394
<i>to feed her son.</i>

361
00:41:39.096 --> 00:41:43.600
<i>She must head</i>
<i>into uncharted territory.</i>

362
00:41:50.207 --> 00:41:51.074
<i>For today's mission,</i>

363
00:41:51.076 --> 00:41:54.777
<i>she brings backup,</i>
<i>leaving Kip safely behind</i>

364
00:41:54.779 --> 00:41:57.814
<i>with a fellow low-ranker.</i>

365
00:41:59.718 --> 00:42:04.153
<i>The upside to this score</i>
<i>could be enormous,</i>

366
00:42:04.155 --> 00:42:06.155
<i>but so are the risks.</i>

367
00:42:09.661 --> 00:42:13.162
<i>The predator encountered</i>
<i>at the edge of the forest</i>

368
00:42:13.164 --> 00:42:16.799
<i>is unpredictable and loud.</i>

369
00:42:18.035 --> 00:42:20.403
<i>The humans.</i>

370
00:42:36.520 --> 00:42:38.521
<i>Maya gets a glimpse.</i>

371
00:42:38.523 --> 00:42:41.624
<i>"Oh! They're terrifying!"</i>

372
00:42:57.274 --> 00:42:58.508
<i>"Hmm."</i>

373
00:42:59.376 --> 00:43:01.544
<i>"Chickens. Very small brains."</i>

374
00:43:01.546 --> 00:43:04.981
<i>"Will they notice</i>
<i>if we take their eggs?"</i>

375
00:43:09.720 --> 00:43:11.521
<i>The lookout gives the signal.</i>

376
00:43:25.135 --> 00:43:26.502
<i>"All clear!"</i>

377
00:43:32.676 --> 00:43:35.044
<i>"In. Confirming we are in."</i>

378
00:43:36.213 --> 00:43:39.983
<i>"No one will ever know</i>
<i>we were here."</i>

379
00:43:39.985 --> 00:43:42.352
<i>"We are like ninjas."</i>

380
00:44:27.498 --> 00:44:30.400
<i>"They're coming.</i>
<i>Quick, last chance!"</i>

381
00:44:36.173 --> 00:44:37.640
<i>"Mmm. I like pink flavor."</i>

382
00:44:37.642 --> 00:44:40.777
<i>"Is this even food?</i>
<i>I don't care!"</i>

383
00:44:42.112 --> 00:44:44.447
<i>"Leave nothing behind,</i>
<i>eat it all!"</i>

384
00:44:45.649 --> 00:44:47.617
<i>"Mm, this is good!"</i>

385
00:44:49.420 --> 00:44:51.421
<i>"Oh, this is delicious!"</i>

386
00:44:54.892 --> 00:44:57.260
<i>"Mm, cake. Love cake!"</i>

387
00:44:58.763 --> 00:45:00.797
<i>"Abort mission!"</i>

388
00:45:01.832 --> 00:45:03.866
<i>"Happy birthday, kid."</i>

389
00:45:11.542 --> 00:45:17.346
<i>Back in the forest,</i>
<i>Maya is reunited with Kip.</i>

390
00:45:18.215 --> 00:45:20.383
<i>The underclass</i>
<i>will retire for the night</i>

391
00:45:20.385 --> 00:45:24.487
<i>with an unfamiliar sensation</i>
<i>in their bellies.</i>

392
00:45:25.756 --> 00:45:28.091
<i>Fullness.</i>

393
00:46:31.922 --> 00:46:36.225
<i>Yesterday's raid can't be</i>
<i>a regular thing.</i>

394
00:46:36.227 --> 00:46:41.430
<i>Maya needs long-term security</i>
<i>for her son.</i>

395
00:46:48.138 --> 00:46:49.071
<i>The next morning,</i>

396
00:46:49.073 --> 00:46:53.609
<i>a lone male surveys</i>
<i>the edge of the kingdom.</i>

397
00:46:55.112 --> 00:46:59.615
<i>Maya will not be</i>
<i>expecting this.</i>

398
00:47:01.151 --> 00:47:03.786
<i>Kumar is back.</i>

399
00:47:10.194 --> 00:47:15.198
<i>He's grown stronger</i>
<i>and smarter in exile.</i>

400
00:47:17.768 --> 00:47:19.769
<i>The young boys are playing,</i>

401
00:47:19.771 --> 00:47:21.871
<i>training for the day</i>
<i>they leave the troop</i>

402
00:47:21.873 --> 00:47:24.507
<i>and attempt Kumar's journey.</i>

403
00:47:24.509 --> 00:47:29.245
<i>This could be the opening</i>
<i>he's been looking for.</i>

404
00:47:29.947 --> 00:47:33.516
<i>A way to ingratiate himself</i>
<i>with the troop</i>

405
00:47:33.518 --> 00:47:35.985
<i>and heal old wounds.</i>

406
00:47:52.603 --> 00:47:56.138
<i>Maya has spotted him.</i>

407
00:48:10.687 --> 00:48:13.155
<i>Finally, they are reunited.</i>

408
00:48:13.157 --> 00:48:17.994
<i>And for the first time,</i>
<i>Kumar meets his son.</i>

409
00:48:17.996 --> 00:48:24.500
<i>But if Maya's man wants</i>
<i>to stay, he's got work to do.</i>

410
00:48:26.003 --> 00:48:30.806
<i>Step one, befriend the alpha's</i>
<i>lieutenants.</i>

411
00:48:38.749 --> 00:48:42.685
<i>Step two,</i>
<i>put in some grooming time.</i>

412
00:48:57.000 --> 00:49:02.838
<i>Soon, Kumar can sit back,</i>
<i>and the others come to him.</i>

413
00:49:05.509 --> 00:49:10.680
<i>But this all means nothing</i>
<i>without the alpha's support.</i>

414
00:49:13.483 --> 00:49:15.217
<i>Step three,</i>

415
00:49:15.219 --> 00:49:18.220
<i>make up with Raja.</i>

416
00:49:18.222 --> 00:49:22.692
<i>Kumar's opportunity arrives</i>
<i>in the form of</i>

417
00:49:23.193 --> 00:49:25.528
<i>jackfruit.</i>

418
00:49:27.297 --> 00:49:30.666
<i>Sloth bears have the best</i>
<i>noses in the forest,</i>

419
00:49:30.668 --> 00:49:33.269
<i>so they always find it first.</i>

420
00:49:34.571 --> 00:49:39.775
<i>Bad-tempered bears usually</i>
<i>keep monkeys away,</i>

421
00:49:40.544 --> 00:49:44.280
<i>but jackfruit makes you</i>
<i>forget your place.</i>

422
00:49:47.451 --> 00:49:51.921
<i>The sisters are quick</i>
<i>to remind you, though.</i>

423
00:49:53.490 --> 00:49:59.295
<i>Because jackfruit isn't</i>
<i>just fruit. It's politics.</i>

424
00:50:01.631 --> 00:50:03.432
<i>If Kumar's learned anything,</i>

425
00:50:03.434 --> 00:50:04.700
<i>he won't steal something</i>

426
00:50:04.702 --> 00:50:07.336
<i>out from under the alpha's</i>
<i>nose again.</i>

427
00:50:07.338 --> 00:50:11.073
<i>No matter how good</i>
<i>that fruit looks.</i>

428
00:50:14.077 --> 00:50:17.847
<i>Maya can only watch</i>
<i>as the fate of Kip's father</i>

429
00:50:17.849 --> 00:50:20.116
<i>hangs in the balance.</i>

430
00:50:20.118 --> 00:50:24.620
<i>Kumar makes a move,</i>
<i>but it's not for the fruit.</i>

431
00:50:24.622 --> 00:50:28.424
<i>He offers his hand</i>
<i>in friendship.</i>

432
00:50:38.135 --> 00:50:43.339
<i>And so, Maya's man earns</i>
<i>a seat at the table.</i>

433
00:50:51.114 --> 00:50:56.752
<i>Raja will soon need</i>
<i>Kumar's strength on his side.</i>

434
00:51:03.560 --> 00:51:07.830
<i>A rival group is sizing up</i>
<i>Castle Rock.</i>

435
00:51:14.504 --> 00:51:18.874
<i>Lex, the leader of</i>
<i>this battle-hardened team.</i>

436
00:51:33.924 --> 00:51:37.193
<i>Raja assesses the threat.</i>

437
00:51:37.195 --> 00:51:40.129
<i>Maya moves Kip to safety.</i>

438
00:51:46.636 --> 00:51:48.003
<i>Raja and the other males</i>

439
00:51:48.005 --> 00:51:50.372
<i>must defend the troop</i>
<i>from invaders.</i>

440
00:51:53.376 --> 00:51:58.247
<i>Branch shaking</i>
<i>is a full-on threat.</i>

441
00:52:02.285 --> 00:52:03.252
<i>In the heat of the moment,</i>

442
00:52:03.254 --> 00:52:06.689
<i>Raja leaves the high ground,</i>
<i>leading his troop</i>

443
00:52:06.691 --> 00:52:08.524
<i>to the enemy.</i>

444
00:52:13.163 --> 00:52:16.832
<i>Playing right into Lex's hands.</i>

445
00:52:17.701 --> 00:52:19.835
<i>The home team follows,</i>

446
00:52:21.138 --> 00:52:24.039
<i>answering Raja's call</i>
<i>for support.</i>

447
00:52:29.980 --> 00:52:32.381
<i>The battle is on.</i>

448
00:52:35.719 --> 00:52:39.088
<i>The combat drifts further</i>
<i>from the rock</i>

449
00:52:39.090 --> 00:52:41.056
<i>and into the jungle.</i>

450
00:52:47.130 --> 00:52:48.497
<i>Sensing easy victory,</i>

451
00:52:48.499 --> 00:52:51.967
<i>the home team is drawn</i>
<i>even further still.</i>

452
00:52:52.969 --> 00:52:55.538
<i>Lex is lying in wait.</i>

453
00:52:58.141 --> 00:53:00.976
<i>The enemy is ready.</i>

454
00:53:02.646 --> 00:53:03.913
<i>Raja's confused.</i>

455
00:53:03.915 --> 00:53:06.182
<i>He can only see one invader.</i>

456
00:53:14.824 --> 00:53:18.127
<i>Time for Lex's crew</i>
<i>to finish the job.</i>

457
00:53:31.575 --> 00:53:33.475
<i>The home team is cornered.</i>

458
00:53:46.389 --> 00:53:50.025
<i>Raja's troop runs for its life.</i>

459
00:54:00.837 --> 00:54:04.773
<i>Castle Rock has a new king.</i>

460
00:54:14.084 --> 00:54:15.284
<i>Raja is wounded.</i>

461
00:54:15.286 --> 00:54:18.254
<i>Leaving the rock and taking</i>
<i>the fight to Lex</i>

462
00:54:18.256 --> 00:54:19.588
<i>was a costly error.</i>

463
00:54:19.590 --> 00:54:24.793
<i>His position as alpha</i>
<i>is on shaky ground now.</i>

464
00:54:27.197 --> 00:54:30.532
<i>Kumar has his own battle scars.</i>

465
00:54:30.534 --> 00:54:33.135
<i>But today, there is worse.</i>

466
00:54:35.905 --> 00:54:39.208
<i>The troop lost</i>
<i>one of their own.</i>

467
00:54:40.043 --> 00:54:43.646
<i>Maya had known this male</i>
<i>for years.</i>

468
00:54:43.648 --> 00:54:46.815
<i>It's as though she</i>
<i>and the others understand</i>

469
00:54:46.817 --> 00:54:49.685
<i>that this is farewell.</i>

470
00:55:28.658 --> 00:55:32.394
<i>They haven't just lost</i>
<i>a friend today,</i>

471
00:55:32.396 --> 00:55:34.096
<i>they've lost their rock castle</i>

472
00:55:34.098 --> 00:55:38.467
<i>and the kingdom that sustained</i>
<i>them for generations.</i>

473
00:55:43.573 --> 00:55:46.175
<i>Maya pushes on</i>

474
00:55:46.177 --> 00:55:49.311
<i>as Kumar chaperones Kip.</i>

475
00:55:51.047 --> 00:55:54.416
<i>Finally, Maya has some</i>
<i>protection for her son.</i>

476
00:55:57.120 --> 00:55:59.955
<i>But the troop is vulnerable.</i>

477
00:55:59.957 --> 00:56:01.623
<i>There's nothing to eat</i>
<i>or drink here,</i>

478
00:56:01.625 --> 00:56:05.527
<i>and Lex's crew could return</i>
<i>to finish them off.</i>

479
00:56:05.529 --> 00:56:08.163
<i>They must keep moving.</i>

480
00:56:13.269 --> 00:56:15.637
<i>Remember him?</i>

481
00:56:15.639 --> 00:56:17.306
<i>The low-born know a monitor,</i>

482
00:56:17.308 --> 00:56:21.076
<i>even out of water,</i>
<i>and sound the alarm.</i>

483
00:56:32.222 --> 00:56:35.891
<i>The nobility isn't familiar</i>
<i>with this creature,</i>

484
00:56:35.893 --> 00:56:40.496
<i>because they never needed</i>
<i>to visit the lily pond.</i>

485
00:56:45.902 --> 00:56:50.072
<i>For once, out in this alien</i>
<i>no man's land,</i>

486
00:56:50.074 --> 00:56:53.108
<i>the commoners have the edge.</i>

487
00:56:56.246 --> 00:56:58.814
<i>For Maya,</i>
<i>the lizard is nothing more</i>

488
00:56:58.816 --> 00:57:01.483
<i>than a fleeting distraction.</i>

489
00:57:09.392 --> 00:57:13.462
<i>With Kip in tow,</i>
<i>she presses on,</i>

490
00:57:13.464 --> 00:57:17.299
<i>and the group</i>
<i>falls into line behind her.</i>

491
00:57:22.906 --> 00:57:26.608
<i>The forest edge</i>
<i>is unfamiliar terrain.</i>

492
00:57:35.985 --> 00:57:38.987
<i>Finally, a place to regroup.</i>

493
00:57:43.693 --> 00:57:49.198
<i>But plover birds don't want</i>
<i>the monkeys near their eggs.</i>

494
00:57:55.371 --> 00:57:58.740
<i>The sisters are on the</i>
<i>receiving end for once</i>

495
00:57:58.742 --> 00:58:01.710
<i>and they do not like it.</i>

496
00:58:05.849 --> 00:58:08.851
<i>Kumar leads Kip to cover</i>

497
00:58:09.319 --> 00:58:12.554
<i>while Maya forges ahead.</i>

498
00:58:35.678 --> 00:58:37.679
<i>Maya is the most equipped</i>

499
00:58:37.681 --> 00:58:39.214
<i>for this challenge.</i>

500
00:58:39.216 --> 00:58:41.550
<i>She knows some stuff about</i>
<i>looking for food</i>

501
00:58:41.552 --> 00:58:44.019
<i>in dangerous places.</i>

502
00:58:53.863 --> 00:58:56.298
<i>The first stop is a bust.</i>

503
00:58:56.300 --> 00:58:58.066
<i>Maya keeps moving.</i>

504
00:58:58.835 --> 00:59:03.305
<i>Adversity is nothing new</i>
<i>for this girl.</i>

505
00:59:07.243 --> 00:59:09.378
<i>Not so for Raja.</i>

506
00:59:10.013 --> 00:59:13.415
<i>Others take the lead now.</i>

507
00:59:17.320 --> 00:59:20.789
<i>The sisters are bewildered.</i>

508
00:59:21.391 --> 00:59:24.726
<i>Even Grandpa fares better.</i>

509
00:59:29.933 --> 00:59:33.235
<i>When the troop finally enters</i>
<i>the urban jungle,</i>

510
00:59:33.237 --> 00:59:34.469
<i>they are ravenous.</i>

511
00:59:34.471 --> 00:59:39.942
<i>Using her instincts,</i>
<i>Maya leads them to the market.</i>

512
00:59:44.881 --> 00:59:47.082
<i>Kumar makes the first move.</i>

513
01:00:02.665 --> 01:00:05.434
<i>He makes it look easy.</i>

514
01:00:06.803 --> 01:00:10.272
<i>His students watch and learn.</i>

515
01:00:22.051 --> 01:00:25.287
<i>Maya is in the thick</i>
<i>of the action</i>

516
01:00:25.289 --> 01:00:28.323
<i>while Kip stays safe above.</i>

517
01:00:32.428 --> 01:00:35.964
<i>The sisters get an A</i>
<i>for effort.</i>

518
01:00:38.401 --> 01:00:41.036
<i>Sure, there's some learning</i>
<i>to be done.</i>

519
01:00:41.038 --> 01:00:43.505
<i>Progress, not perfection.</i>

520
01:01:09.599 --> 01:01:11.767
<i>With stomachs full,</i>
<i>the troop can explore</i>

521
01:01:11.769 --> 01:01:15.370
<i>whatever else the city</i>
<i>has to offer.</i>

522
01:01:16.172 --> 01:01:18.674
<i>A seat for Grandpa.</i>

523
01:01:19.308 --> 01:01:23.245
<i>A little drink from this thing.</i>

524
01:01:26.182 --> 01:01:27.916
<i>"Oh, boy!"</i>

525
01:01:32.088 --> 01:01:33.455
<i>"What is that?"</i>

526
01:01:33.457 --> 01:01:37.426
<i>"It's furry,</i>
<i>about the size of a langur."</i>

527
01:01:40.430 --> 01:01:43.131
<i>"Do you speak monkey?"</i>

528
01:01:50.540 --> 01:01:53.108
<i>"Dude, what are you?"</i>

529
01:01:53.110 --> 01:01:56.144
<i>"It likes being groomed."</i>

530
01:02:03.419 --> 01:02:08.223
<i>Okay, maybe man's best friend</i>
<i>is also monkey's best friend.</i>

531
01:02:20.336 --> 01:02:22.838
<i>"No, it's because we like to</i>
<i>bite each other's tails.</i>

532
01:02:22.840 --> 01:02:25.107
<i>"Is that not a thing... Okay."</i>

533
01:02:35.351 --> 01:02:37.919
<i>"Think he'll let me ride him?"</i>

534
01:02:39.756 --> 01:02:42.157
<i>"Same time tomorrow?"</i>

535
01:02:42.825 --> 01:02:46.428
<i>Our troop has sampled</i>
<i>city cuisine.</i>

536
01:02:46.430 --> 01:02:49.097
<i>Kip has even met the wildlife.</i>

537
01:02:49.099 --> 01:02:52.033
<i>All that's left</i>
<i>is a place to stay.</i>

538
01:02:52.035 --> 01:02:57.639
<i>High above the palm.</i>
<i>Now, that's a sleeping tree.</i>

539
01:03:09.152 --> 01:03:11.620
<i>Kumar leads them up.</i>

540
01:03:19.796 --> 01:03:24.199
<i>The troop settles in</i>
<i>for the night, nice and cozy.</i>

541
01:03:26.502 --> 01:03:30.839
<i>Hmm. Well, it's actually</i>
<i>not that cozy.</i>

542
01:03:30.841 --> 01:03:33.575
<i>Okay, not at all.</i>

543
01:03:35.478 --> 01:03:37.212
<i>What Maya and Kip wouldn't give</i>

544
01:03:37.214 --> 01:03:40.048
<i>for their wooden branch</i>
<i>at home.</i>

545
01:03:42.051 --> 01:03:44.486
<i>At least it's quiet.</i>

546
01:03:51.627 --> 01:03:55.030
<i>"You're kidding, right?"</i>

547
01:03:57.400 --> 01:04:00.101
<i>"It's gonna be a long night."</i>

548
01:04:12.448 --> 01:04:15.217
<i>Nope, this won't do at all.</i>

549
01:04:15.219 --> 01:04:17.619
<i>Castle Rock is home.</i>

550
01:04:17.621 --> 01:04:20.055
<i>But before the troop</i>
<i>can win it back,</i>

551
01:04:20.057 --> 01:04:22.424
<i>they have to build up</i>
<i>their reserves</i>

552
01:04:22.426 --> 01:04:23.959
<i>for the tough fight ahead.</i>

553
01:04:23.961 --> 01:04:28.763
<i>This will require a focused</i>
<i>assault on the town.</i>

554
01:05:49.412 --> 01:05:51.980
<i>Wounds healed</i>
<i>and strength regained,</i>

555
01:05:51.982 --> 01:05:54.115
<i>the troop is ready to head home</i>

556
01:05:54.117 --> 01:05:57.218
<i>and reclaim</i>
<i>what's rightfully theirs.</i>

557
01:06:49.238 --> 01:06:52.474
<i>Together, on the edge of</i>
<i>their territory,</i>

558
01:06:52.476 --> 01:06:54.542
<i>they wash away the city</i>

559
01:06:54.544 --> 01:06:57.746
<i>and relish the jungle</i>
<i>all around them.</i>

560
01:06:57.748 --> 01:07:02.650
<i>The line between high-born</i>
<i>and low-born remains blurred.</i>

561
01:07:02.652 --> 01:07:06.254
<i>It may not stay this way</i>
<i>forever, but for now,</i>

562
01:07:06.256 --> 01:07:08.223
<i>it's enough.</i>

563
01:07:48.898 --> 01:07:53.268
<i>Kip and his new friends</i>
<i>seem happy to be back.</i>

564
01:07:55.137 --> 01:07:57.138
<i>But Maya can't relax yet.</i>

565
01:07:57.140 --> 01:08:01.509
<i>The hardest part</i>
<i>of the journey lies ahead.</i>

566
01:08:07.950 --> 01:08:11.453
<i>Kumar leads the troop home.</i>

567
01:08:11.455 --> 01:08:15.457
<i>Maya and Kip</i>
<i>follow him closely.</i>

568
01:08:17.259 --> 01:08:21.262
<i>The sisters, still humbled</i>
<i>from their time in the city,</i>

569
01:08:21.264 --> 01:08:23.198
<i>trail behind them.</i>

570
01:08:23.200 --> 01:08:27.502
<i>Raja is no longer at the front.</i>

571
01:08:36.245 --> 01:08:39.781
<i>Kumar has Castle Rock</i>
<i>in his sights.</i>

572
01:08:39.783 --> 01:08:42.517
<i>The enemy is home.</i>

573
01:08:44.553 --> 01:08:48.990
<i>Lex senses something is wrong.</i>

574
01:08:49.525 --> 01:08:52.460
<i>Kumar remains hidden.</i>

575
01:08:54.196 --> 01:08:56.598
<i>Maya has left Kip at the rear</i>

576
01:08:56.600 --> 01:08:58.967
<i>and is close behind.</i>

577
01:09:02.338 --> 01:09:05.073
<i>The soldiers assume</i>
<i>their positions.</i>

578
01:09:12.448 --> 01:09:15.183
<i>The enemy still hasn't</i>
<i>seen Kumar,</i>

579
01:09:15.185 --> 01:09:17.519
<i>and the troop is nearly set.</i>

580
01:09:21.423 --> 01:09:25.727
<i>Lex can see movement,</i>
<i>but can't know what's coming.</i>

581
01:09:25.729 --> 01:09:28.396
<i>Grandpa is going in.</i>

582
01:09:41.076 --> 01:09:44.579
<i>Kumar makes his move.</i>

583
01:09:45.581 --> 01:09:48.183
<i>Not good for Lex.</i>

584
01:10:01.931 --> 01:10:05.466
<i>Maya is on the front line.</i>

585
01:10:09.038 --> 01:10:10.972
<i>Go, Grandpa!</i>

586
01:10:12.341 --> 01:10:16.411
<i>Soon, our troop</i>
<i>scales Castle Rock.</i>

587
01:10:23.986 --> 01:10:28.990
<i>Kumar lays his claim</i>
<i>as king of this castle.</i>

588
01:10:37.433 --> 01:10:42.136
<i>Overpowered,</i>
<i>Lex and his team retreat.</i>

589
01:10:47.309 --> 01:10:51.012
<i>Finally, the troop is home.</i>

590
01:10:58.988 --> 01:11:03.925
<i>For Maya and the troop,</i>
<i>it's great to be back.</i>

591
01:11:07.730 --> 01:11:09.664
<i>First, the jungle gym.</i>

592
01:11:10.432 --> 01:11:12.166
<i>Yup, still good.</i>

593
01:11:18.340 --> 01:11:22.610
<i>Then, it's time to catch up</i>
<i>with old friends.</i>

594
01:11:29.218 --> 01:11:31.986
<i>And let's not forget</i>
<i>you-know-who.</i>

595
01:11:33.522 --> 01:11:37.058
<i>It's pretty obvious that</i>
<i>he has missed them.</i>

596
01:11:40.095 --> 01:11:41.129
<i>Now,</i>

597
01:11:41.131 --> 01:11:42.297
<i>street smart from the town,</i>

598
01:11:42.299 --> 01:11:44.966
<i>they collect rent</i>
<i>from their tenants.</i>

599
01:11:47.136 --> 01:11:50.672
<i>"Look, we're all reasonable</i>
<i>forest creatures here.</i>

600
01:11:50.674 --> 01:11:53.308
<i>"We're not gonna eat you,</i>

601
01:11:53.310 --> 01:11:56.010
<i>"but we are gonna eat</i>
<i>your fruit.</i>

602
01:11:56.012 --> 01:11:57.912
<i>"So, hand it over."</i>

603
01:12:00.516 --> 01:12:03.718
<i>The youngsters have grown</i>
<i>in confidence</i>

604
01:12:03.720 --> 01:12:05.887
<i>since their urban adventure.</i>

605
01:12:05.889 --> 01:12:07.322
<i>Especially Kip,</i>

606
01:12:07.324 --> 01:12:10.858
<i>whose curiosity has blossomed.</i>

607
01:12:25.674 --> 01:12:30.244
<i>Castle Rock remains</i>
<i>a stronghold for our troop</i>

608
01:12:30.813 --> 01:12:32.513
<i>as a year passes,</i>

609
01:12:32.515 --> 01:12:37.218
<i>and another monsoon season</i>
<i>comes and goes.</i>

610
01:12:56.038 --> 01:13:00.575
<i>The precious fig tree</i>
<i>is back in fruit.</i>

611
01:13:12.688 --> 01:13:16.624
<i>And this time, Maya is in it.</i>

612
01:13:22.131 --> 01:13:27.702
<i>These days, Maya enjoys a new</i>
<i>acceptance by the sisters.</i>

613
01:13:27.704 --> 01:13:28.703
<i>Then again,</i>

614
01:13:28.705 --> 01:13:30.571
<i>some things never change.</i>

615
01:13:31.408 --> 01:13:34.642
<i>Yeah, yeah, you're still</i>
<i>a big deal. We get it.</i>

616
01:13:36.545 --> 01:13:40.348
<i>The sisters are still</i>
<i>attended to by Raja,</i>

617
01:13:40.350 --> 01:13:42.917
<i>but he's lost their support.</i>

618
01:13:45.387 --> 01:13:48.756
<i>Whereas Grandpa</i>
<i>just keeps on going,</i>

619
01:13:48.758 --> 01:13:53.027
<i>a role model for generations</i>
<i>of young monkeys.</i>

620
01:13:55.330 --> 01:14:00.835
<i>Kip is now a well-fed</i>
<i>and healthy little boy.</i>

621
01:14:00.837 --> 01:14:02.870
<i>He has a knack</i>
<i>for making friends,</i>

622
01:14:02.872 --> 01:14:07.375
<i>and an independence</i>
<i>that is growing by the day.</i>

623
01:14:13.248 --> 01:14:15.950
<i>Kip isn't just surviving,</i>

624
01:14:16.485 --> 01:14:18.853
<i>he's thriving.</i>

625
01:14:22.891 --> 01:14:25.827
<i>Kumar, now the alpha</i>
<i>of the troop,</i>

626
01:14:25.829 --> 01:14:28.362
<i>snuggles against Maya</i>

627
01:14:28.364 --> 01:14:31.799
<i>and their brand new baby girl.</i>

628
01:14:32.768 --> 01:14:35.570
<i>This infant's future</i>
<i>will be secure.</i>

629
01:14:35.572 --> 01:14:37.905
<i>She will know nothing</i>
<i>of the struggle</i>

630
01:14:37.907 --> 01:14:40.675
<i>once endured by her brother.</i>

631
01:14:49.952 --> 01:14:54.188
<i>Kip now has a vibrant future</i>
<i>ahead of him,</i>

632
01:14:54.190 --> 01:14:56.524
<i>thanks to his mother.</i>

633
01:15:03.599 --> 01:15:08.870
<i>Against all odds,</i>
<i>Maya made this possible.</i>

634
01:16:47.636 --> 01:16:49.770
I think he's chasing
for the jeeps.

635
01:16:49.772 --> 01:16:51.672
A little bit angry, eh?

636
01:16:54.643 --> 01:16:56.210
I'm getting nice little...

637
01:17:07.155 --> 01:17:08.589
They've just started emerging.

638
01:17:08.591 --> 01:17:10.591
You can see them behind me.

639
01:17:10.593 --> 01:17:11.692
<i>We've had a little bit of rain,</i>

640
01:17:11.694 --> 01:17:13.894
<i>and it has obviously softened
up the termite mounds.</i>

641
01:17:13.896 --> 01:17:15.129
<i>Some of them are coming out,</i>

642
01:17:15.131 --> 01:17:18.733
<i>and the monkeys</i>
<i>are just picking them off.</i>

643
01:17:30.680 --> 01:17:32.146
About 17 weeks

644
01:17:32.148 --> 01:17:33.781
we've been waiting for that.

645
01:17:33.783 --> 01:17:38.653
It feels like we've been
filming here for six years.

646
01:18:07.482 --> 01:18:09.083
What makes this
more exciting is

647
01:18:09.085 --> 01:18:11.919
it's not just mongooses
that live down here.

648
01:18:11.921 --> 01:18:13.354
About four weeks ago,

649
01:18:13.356 --> 01:18:16.357
we saw a cobra
going in and out.

650
01:18:24.733 --> 01:18:26.100
We're coming.
